# (Thalia taxes every noncreature spell {1}, hers too: four Moxen pay for the Onslaught.) Devastating Onslaught for X=1 copies Bot1's Thalia, Guardian of Thraben, a legendary creature: the token is a legendary Thalia
# too, so the legend rule (CR 704.5j) has Bot1 choose one to keep. Bot1 keeps the TOKEN: the original Thalia goes to the graveyard
# and the token, the only Thalia left, is sacrificed at the beginning of the end step (CR 603.7c). At the end Bot1 has no Thalia
# at all, one Thalia card in the graveyard. (The scenario with the original kept is the sibling.)

